<bioghist encodinganalog="545$a">
<head>Biographical Information
</head>
<p>Maplewood Cemetery was established as the town of Charlottesville's first official resting place for the dead in 1827.
</p>
</bioghist>

<scopecontent encodinganalog="520$a">
<head>Scope and Content
</head>
<p>This collection contains surveys and inventories of each section of Maplewood Cemetery. It includes the condition, notes structures, plantings, burials, and purchase records.
</p>
</scopecontent>

